		<description><![CDATA[<p>On this day, November 11, 2005, nine years ago, Madonna&#8216;s Confessions On A Dance Floor was released. When I wrote [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/day-madonnas-confessions-dance-floor-released-9-years-ago/20141111">On this day: Madonna&#8217;s Confessions On A Dance Floor was released 9 years ago.</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>On this day, November 11, 2005, nine years ago, <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s <strong>Confessions On A Dance Floor</strong> was released.</p>
<blockquote><p>When I wrote American Life, I was very agitated by what was going on in the world around me, [&#8230;] I was angry. I had a lot to get off my chest. I made a lot of political statements. But now, I feel that I just want to have fun; I want to dance; I want to feel buoyant. And I want to give other people the same feeling. There&#8217;s a lot of madness in the world around us, and I want people to be happy.<br />
-<a href="http://www.mtv.com/bands/m/madonna/news_feature_051107/" target="_blank"><strong>Madonna</strong></a></p></blockquote>
<p>Musically <strong>Confessions On A Dance Floor</strong> is a full-on dance, electronic and disco masterpiece, structured like a set composed by a DJ.</p>
<p>Critically the album was very well acclaimed from music critics, with a score of 80/100 on Metacritic.</p>
<p><strong>Confessions On A Dance Floor</strong> peaked at #<strong>1</strong> in <strong>40</strong> countries, earning the record as the album topping the charts in most countries.<br />
In USA it peaked at #<strong>1</strong> with <strong>350.000</strong> units sold (total so far: <strong>1.708.294</strong>).<br />
In UK the album peaked at #<strong>1</strong> with <strong>217.610</strong> copies. To date it has sold <strong>1.300.000</strong>.<br />
Although Confessions On A Dance Floor was released on November 2005, it was still the 6th world&#8217;s biggest-selling album of the year, with more than 6.300.000 copies sold, according to the International Federation of the Phonographic Industry.</p>
<p>The album has sold worldwide around <strong><a href="http://blogs.suntimes.com/music/2008/04/madonna_hard_candy_warner_bros.html" target="_blank">12.000.000</a></strong> copies so far.</p>
<p>The singles released are 4: <strong>Hung Up</strong>, <strong>Sorry</strong>, <strong>Get Together</strong>, <strong>Jump</strong>.</p>
<p>Which is your favourite track?</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/day-madonnas-confessions-dance-floor-released-9-years-ago/20141111">On this day: Madonna&#8217;s Confessions On A Dance Floor was released 9 years ago.</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
